.el .ds Aq '
.TH garuda-toolbox-locales 1  "garuda-toolbox 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
garuda\-toolbox\-locales \- Turn locales on or off and set the system language
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgaruda\-toolbox locales\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fIWHEN\fR] [\fB\-\-width\fR \fICOLUMNS\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn locales on or off and set the system language
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the programs\*(Aq own words under an error
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Print long text directly instead of through `$PAGER`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Colour the output: auto, always or never
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-width\fR \fI<COLUMNS>\fR
Cut long cells to this many columns
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Leave out the spinner and the hints
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-locales\-list(1)
List the locales: enabled, the system\*(Aqs, and the ones on offer
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-locales\-enable(1)
Enable a locale, so programs can use it
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-locales\-disable(1)
Disable a locale. The system\*(Aqs locale stays
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-locales\-system(1)
Make a locale the system\*(Aqs language. It is enabled too
.TP
garuda\-toolbox\-locales\-packs(1)
The translations of installed programs for the enabled locales
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  garuda\-toolbox locales system de_DE.UTF\-8
.SH "SEE ALSO"
garuda\-toolbox(1)
